#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md:1
msgid "怪物Spine动作制作需求"
msgstr "Monster Spine Animation Production Requirements"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md:3
msgid "制作要求"
msgstr "Production Requirements"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md:5
msgid "1.备注的动作过程仅用作参考，如果有更好的设计想法可以不同于备注描述来制作。"
msgstr ""
"1. The action process in the notes is for reference only. If you have "
"better design ideas, you may deviate from the note descriptions."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md:6
msgid "2.除了普通攻击类型的攻击技能都需要做出明确的前摇部分。前摇动作时长先自行设计，后期再根据游戏机制再做调整。"
msgstr ""
"2. All attack skills except normal attack types need a clear wind-up "
"animation. Design the wind-up duration yourself initially; it will be "
"adjusted later based on game mechanics."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md:7
msgid "3.“移动”动画在脚步落地时增加事件帧，名为“step”，用于绑定音效。"
msgstr ""
"3. Add an event frame named \"step\" to the \"Move\" animation when the "
"foot hits the ground, for binding sound effects."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md:8
msgid "4.除大招以及原地小跳类的动作需要去除动作描述中的较长距离的位移，用于后续在程序中进行控制实现。"
msgstr ""
"4. Except for ultimate skills and small in-place jump actions, longer-"
"distance displacement in the action descriptions should be removed, to be"
" implemented programmatically later."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md:10
msgid "需求清单"
msgstr "Requirements Checklist"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md:12
