#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "失去活力，原地坐下，进入晕眩待机状态。<br>需要拆成进入晕眩状态和晕眩状态循环待机两个部分"
msgstr ""
"Loses vitality, sits down in place, enters dizzy idle state.<br>Needs to "
"be split into two parts: entering dizzy state and dizzy state loop idle"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
