msgstr "6"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "击败"
msgstr "Defeated"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "lose"
msgstr "lose"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "7"
msgstr "7"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "向前滚动"
msgstr "Forward Roll"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "roll"
msgstr "roll"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>1.卷曲身体变成球状<br>2.原地旋转加速，开始滚动<br>3.旋转减速，后跳一小步回复姿态<br>>技能效果介绍<br>持续向前滚动，并将前方群体对象撞退一定距离"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>1. Curl body into a ball shape<br>2. "
"Spin in place to accelerate, begin rolling<br>3. Slow down spinning, take"
" a small backward hop to recover pose<br>>Skill Effect "
"Description<br>Continuously roll forward, knocking back a group of "
"targets ahead a certain distance"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "8"
msgstr "8"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "甩尾挥击"
msgstr "Tail Swipe"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "blow"
msgstr "blow"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>1.做出蓄力的前摇姿态<br>2.侧身向前甩动尾巴发动攻击<br>3.回复到待机姿态<br>>技能效果介绍<br>单体横向击飞对手"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>1. Assume a charging wind-up pose<br>2. "
"Turn sideways and swing tail forward to attack<br>3. Return to idle "
"pose<br>>Skill Effect Description<br>Knocks a single target horizontally"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "9"
msgstr "9"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "跳跃甩尾"
msgstr "Jump Tail Swing"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "swing"
msgstr "swing"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>原地小跳并在空中从后方向前摆动尾巴进行普通攻击<br>>技能效果介绍<br>单体伤害对手，无击退效果"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>Small in-place jump, swinging tail from "
"back to front in the air for a normal attack<br>>Skill Effect "
"Description<br>Deals damage to a single target, no knockback effect"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "10"
msgstr "10"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "用角顶撞"
msgstr "Horn Thrust"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "butt"
msgstr "butt"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>1.俯身低头，让头上的角面朝下前方<br>2.向前迈步，同时把角用力向上挥击<br>3.回复到待机姿态<br>>技能效果介绍<br>单体伤害对手，造成纵向击飞效果"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>1. Lean forward and lower head, pointing"
" horns downward-forward<br>2. Step forward while forcefully swinging "
"horns upward<br>3. Return to idle pose<br>>Skill Effect "
"Description<br>Deals damage to a single target, causes vertical knockup "
"effect"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "11"
msgstr "11"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "滚动炸弹"
msgstr "Rolling Bomb"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "bomb"
msgstr "bomb"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>身体向下倾，摆动手臂向地面抛出一个会向前滚动的炸弹（打保龄球）<br>>技能效果介绍<br>炸弹碰到对手后造成范围伤害，无击退效果"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>Lean body downward, swing arm to throw a"
" forward-rolling bomb at the ground (bowling motion)<br>>Skill Effect "
"Description<br>Bomb deals area damage upon contacting opponents, no "
"knockback effect"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md:30
msgid "2.大饕餮"
msgstr "2. Great Taotie"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "做咆哮状"
msgstr "Roaring pose"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "向前拍击"
msgstr "Forward Slam"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "trample"
msgstr "trample"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>单个前肢向前抬起后向下拍击，发动普通攻击<br>>技能效果介绍<br>单体造成伤害，无击退效果"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>Single front limb raised forward then "
"slammed down for a normal attack<br>>Skill Effect Description<br>Deals "
"damage to a single target, no knockback effect"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "尾巴挥击"
msgstr "Tail Swing"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>尾巴抬起向身后挥击<br>>技能效果介绍<br>攻击群体对象，造成击退效果"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>Tail raised and swung behind<br>>Skill "
"Effect Description<br>Attacks a group of targets, causes knockback effect"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "前扑攻击"
msgstr "Pounce Attack"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "pounce"
msgstr "pounce"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>1.身体向下做伏地状，做前扑准备<br>2.突然发力，后肢支撑抬起前肢并向下前方扑击<br>3.回复姿态<br>>技能效果介绍<br>攻击群体对象，造成横向击飞效果"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>1. Lower body to the ground in a prone "
"position, preparing to pounce<br>2. Suddenly push off, hind legs support "
"while front limbs lift and pounce forward-downward<br>3. Return to "
"pose<br>>Skill Effect Description<br>Attacks a group of targets, causes "
"horizontal knockup effect"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "机枪攻击"
msgstr "Machine Gun Attack"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "shot"
msgstr "shot"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>身体后倾，使用机枪由近向远连续扫射，扫射过程中后肢支撑身体逐渐前倾<br>>技能效果介绍<br>攻击群体对象，无击退效果"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>Lean body backward, use machine gun to "
"continuously sweep fire from near to far, body gradually leans forward "
"during firing as hind legs support<br>>Skill Effect "
"Description<br>Attacks a group of targets, no knockback effect"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "野蛮冲撞（大招）"
msgstr "Savage Charge (Ultimate)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "rush"
msgstr "rush"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>1.仰头进行咆哮<br>2.身体后倾做起跑准备<br>3.突然四肢发力开始奔跑<br>4.做出奔跑减速的动作，回复待机姿态<br>>技能效果介绍<br>怪物进入霸体状态并产生横向位移，撞飞所有接触到的单位"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>1. Raise head and roar<br>2. Lean body "
"backward in starting position<br>3. Suddenly push off with all four limbs"
" and begin running<br>4. Decelerate running motion, return to idle "
"pose<br>>Skill Effect Description<br>Monster enters super armor state "
"with horizontal displacement, knocking away all units it contacts"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md:48
msgid "3.小山魈"
msgstr "3. Little Mandrill"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "左右脚交替跺地共五次，节奏为“哒哒哒哒哒”（逐渐暴躁），跺完后扶一下耳机"
msgstr ""
"Alternate left and right foot stomping five times in rhythm \"da-da-da-"
"da-da\" (progressively agitated), then adjust earpiece after stomping"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "手臂后的火焰熄灭，原地坐下，进入晕眩待机状态。需要拆成进入晕眩状态和晕眩状态循环待机两个部分"
msgstr ""
"Flames behind arms extinguish, sits down in place, enters dizzy idle "
"state. Needs to be split into entering dizzy state and dizzy state loop "
"idle"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "直立行走的猩猩姿态"
msgstr "Upright walking gorilla posture"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "投石攻击"
msgstr "Rock Throw Attack"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "throw"
msgstr "throw"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>1.身体后倾，手向后摆，做出棒球投掷的起势动作<br>2.手向前挥，进行抛物<br>3.回复到待机姿态<br>>技能效果介绍<br>以投掷物攻击单体对象，无击退效果"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>1. Lean body backward, arm swings back "
"in a baseball pitching wind-up<br>2. Arm swings forward to throw<br>3. "
"Return to idle pose<br>>Skill Effect Description<br>Attacks a single "
"target with a thrown object, no knockback effect"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "后跳躲避"
msgstr "Back Jump Evade"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "evade"
msgstr "evade"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>1.身体下倾，手臂往后挥，做立定跳远的起跳准备<br>2.开始跳跃下落<br>3.回复待机姿态<br>>技能效果介绍<br>当周围没有BOSS级怪物，并且不存在大于等于3只其它小型怪物时，会使用该技能做后跳位移远离玩家"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>1. Lean body down, arms swing back, "
"preparing for a standing long jump<br>2. Begin jumping and landing<br>3. "
"Return to idle pose<br>>Skill Effect Description<br>When there are no "
"BOSS-level monsters nearby and fewer than 3 other small monsters present,"
" uses this skill to back-jump away from the player"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "疯狂投掷"
msgstr "Frenzy Throw"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "litter"
msgstr "litter"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>1.原地起跳<br>2.在空中先后挥舞双臂进行两次投掷攻击<br>3.落地并回复待机姿态<br>>技能效果介绍<br>当周围有BOSS级怪物，或是存在大于等于2只其它小型怪物时，会使用该技能发动更强力的攻击"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>1. Jump in place<br>2. In the air, swing"
" both arms alternately for two throwing attacks<br>3. Land and return to "
"idle pose<br>>Skill Effect Description<br>When there are BOSS-level "
"monsters nearby or 2 or more other small monsters present, uses this "
"skill for a more powerful attack"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "向前冲击"
msgstr "Forward Charge"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>1.向前抬起双手，肩后的火焰变大，双脚浮空<br>2.向前悬浮冲刺一段距离<br>3.在空中后空翻转一圈后落地，回复待机姿态<br>>技能效果介绍<br>当周围有BOSS级怪物，或是存在大于等于2只其它小型怪物时，会使用该技能。和路径上的第一个敌人碰撞后结束技能，并造成中等伤害"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>1. Raise both hands forward, flames "
"behind shoulders grow larger, feet leave ground<br>2. Hover-dash forward "
"a distance<br>3. Do a backflip in the air and land, return to idle "
"pose<br>>Skill Effect Description<br>When there are BOSS-level monsters "
"nearby or 2 or more other small monsters present, uses this skill. Ends "
"upon colliding with the first enemy in path, dealing moderate damage"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "爪击"
msgstr "Claw Strike"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "scratch"
msgstr "scratch"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>双爪交叉挥舞两次进行普通攻击<br>>技能效果介绍<br>造成单体伤害，无击退效果"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>Cross-swing both claws twice for a "
"normal attack<br>>Skill Effect Description<br>Deals single-target damage,"
" no knockback effect"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md:66
msgid "4.大山魈"
msgstr "4. Great Mandrill"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "腰挺直，抖一抖披风，摆动头上的角"
msgstr "Straighten waist, shake cape, swing horns on head"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "背弯下，手撑着脚部附近地面，触角和斗篷无力垂下，进入晕眩待机状态。需要拆成进入晕眩状态和晕眩状态循环待机两个部分"
msgstr ""
"Back bends down, hands support ground near feet, antennae and cape droop "
"limply, enters dizzy idle state. Needs to be split into entering dizzy "
"state and dizzy state loop idle"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "投掷物体"
msgstr "Throw Object"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>1.拾取地面上的道具，举起道具开始蓄力<br>2.用力向前方投掷出<br>3.回复待机姿态<br>>技能效果介绍<br>在身边有可互动的道具时发动，投掷出的道具有物理碰撞的效果，并撞飞接触的多个单位"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>1. Pick up item from ground, raise it "
"and begin charging<br>2. Forcefully throw it forward<br>3. Return to idle"
" pose<br>>Skill Effect Description<br>Activated when there are "
"interactive items nearby. Thrown item has physical collision effect, "
"knocking away multiple units it contacts"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "双手砸地"
msgstr "Double Hand Ground Slam"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "slum"
msgstr "slum"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>抬起双手，用力三次砸向地面<br>>技能效果介绍<br>范围群体攻击，造成生命值和体力消耗，体力耗尽的单位会被击倒"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>Raise both hands, forcefully slam ground"
" three times<br>>Skill Effect Description<br>Area group attack, causes HP"
" and stamina depletion. Units with exhausted stamina are knocked down"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "挥拳攻击"
msgstr "Punch Attack"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "punch"
msgstr "punch"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>1.双手拍下拳头，做出出拳准备<br>2.向前出拳打出三连击<br>3.回复待机姿态<br>>技能效果介绍<br>单体连续受到攻击，消耗生命值和体力，攻击过程中体力耗尽的单位会被击倒"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>1. Slam both fists down in punching "
"preparation<br>2. Punch forward with a three-hit combo<br>3. Return to "
"idle pose<br>>Skill Effect Description<br>Single target takes consecutive"
" hits, depleting HP and stamina. Units with exhausted stamina during the "
"attack are knocked down"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "暗影偷袭（大招）"
msgstr "Shadow Ambush (Ultimate)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "ambush"
msgstr "ambush"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>1.身后出现一个竖直的传送门<br>2.后跳一步进入传送门，同时传送门变消失<br>3.空中出现横向的传送门<br>4.从传送门中落下，向地面发动下落攻击，同时横向传送门消失<br>5.回复待机姿态<br>>技能效果介绍<br>原地消失，并瞬移到目标单位的上方发动下落范围群体攻击"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>1. A vertical portal appears "
"behind<br>2. Back-step into the portal, portal disappears "
"simultaneously<br>3. A horizontal portal appears in the air<br>4. Fall "
"from the portal, launching a downward attack toward the ground, "
"horizontal portal disappears simultaneously<br>5. Return to idle "
"pose<br>>Skill Effect Description<br>Disappears in place, teleports above"
" the target unit and launches a falling area group attack"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md:83
msgid "5.小狐狸"
msgstr "5. Little Fox"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "尾巴下垂，后腿蹲到地面，前腿支持起上身，摆动耳朵"
msgstr ""
"Tail droops, hind legs crouch to ground, front legs support upper body, "
"ears wiggle"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "趴到在地面，进入晕眩待机状态。需要拆成进入晕眩状态和晕眩状态循环待机两个部分"
msgstr ""
"Lies flat on the ground, enters dizzy idle state. Needs to be split into "
"entering dizzy state and dizzy state loop idle"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "魅惑之舞"
msgstr "Charming Dance"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "charm"
msgstr "charm"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>晃动脑袋，摆动尾巴<br>>技能效果介绍<br>发动时间结束后，让单个单位陷入迷惑状态，停止行动，迷惑状态期间受到攻击会中断效果"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>Shake head, wag tail<br>>Skill Effect "
"Description<br>After the activation time ends, puts a single unit into a "
"confused state, stopping their actions. Being attacked during confusion "
"interrupts the effect"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "脑袋撞击"
msgstr "Headbutt"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "charge"
msgstr "charge"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>向前小跳一步，并同时耳朵向后摆，低下头做脑袋向前顶的动作<br>>技能效果介绍<br>对前方单个单位造成少量伤害，无击退效果，当击中单位处于迷惑状态时造成3倍伤害"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>Take a small forward hop while ears "
"swing back, lower head to thrust forward<br>>Skill Effect "
"Description<br>Deals minor damage to a single unit ahead, no knockback "
"effect. Deals 3x damage when hitting a confused unit"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "伪装攻击/装死"
msgstr "Disguise Attack / Play Dead"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "pretend"
msgstr "pretend"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>1.从被击败的动作结束姿态开始行动<br>2.跃起用脑袋发动全力一击<br>3.回复待机状态<br>>技能效果介绍<br>在承受随机的少量伤害后，会假装做出被击败的动作，蜷缩在地面，处于无法被攻击的状态，如果有单位在6秒内靠近会受到攻击并被击飞，如果伪装时间超过6秒没有单位靠近，则回复待机姿态"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>1. Start from the defeated animation's "
"ending pose<br>2. Leap up and deliver a full-power head strike<br>3. "
"Return to idle pose<br>>Skill Effect Description<br>After taking random "
"minor damage, pretends to be defeated, curling up on the ground in an "
"untargetable state. If any unit approaches within 6 seconds, it attacks "
"and knocks them away. If no unit approaches within 6 seconds, returns to "
"idle pose"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "攻击迟疑"
msgstr "Attack Hesitation"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "cute"
msgstr "cute"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>前腿向前伸，上身下倾，摇动尾巴做示好状<br>>技能效果介绍<br>开始发动技能后，受到影响的单个单位攻击速度和命中率会下降"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>Front legs stretch forward, upper body "
"tilts down, wag tail in a friendly gesture<br>>Skill Effect "
"Description<br>After skill activation begins, the affected single unit's "
"attack speed and accuracy decrease"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md:100
msgid "6.大狐狸"
msgstr "6. Great Fox"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "待机状态下手上的光刃是隐藏的"
msgstr "Light blades on hands are hidden during idle state"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "做一个搔首弄姿的动作"
msgstr "Do a flirtatious pose"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "垂下头，用手护着脑袋，双膝跪地，进入晕眩待机状态。需要拆成进入晕眩状态和晕眩状态循环待机两个部分"
msgstr ""
"Head droops, hands protect head, kneels on both knees, enters dizzy idle "
"state. Needs to be split into entering dizzy state and dizzy state loop "
"idle"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "光刃三连击"
msgstr "Light Blade Triple Strike"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "slice"
msgstr "slice"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>1.手臂伸出光刃<br>2.身体重心下移，做出攻击准备姿态<br>3.发动快速地三连击，然后回复待机姿态<br>>技能效果介绍<br>对单个单位发动连续攻击，无击退效果，对迷惑状态的单位造成3倍伤害"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>1. Light blades extend from arms<br>2. "
"Lower center of gravity, assume attack preparation pose<br>3. Execute "
"rapid triple strike, then return to idle pose<br>>Skill Effect "
"Description<br>Launches consecutive attacks on a single unit, no "
"knockback effect. Deals 3x damage to confused units"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "反弹子弹"
msgstr "Bullet Deflect"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "parry"
msgstr "parry"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>1.单脚后退一步呈弓步站立姿态，手臂在胸前交叉，做出格挡动作（类似神奇女侠挡子弹）<br>2.手臂保持格挡姿势一段时间后，双手向下挥动，做反弹攻击的动作<br>3.回复待机姿态<br>>技能效果介绍<br>进入一段时间的格挡状态，期间受到的枪械攻击失效，格挡结束后会将格挡下的子弹、榴弹、能量射线等向攻击者的方向反弹。如果格挡期间未受到攻击，则反弹动作时发出攻击波，群体造成伤害和击退效果"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>1. Step back with one foot into a lunge "
"stance, arms crossed in front of chest in a blocking pose (similar to "
"Wonder Woman deflecting bullets)<br>2. Maintain blocking pose for a "
"period, then swing both hands downward in a deflection attack "
"motion<br>3. Return to idle pose<br>>Skill Effect Description<br>Enters a"
" blocking state for a period, during which firearm attacks are negated. "
"After blocking ends, deflects blocked bullets, grenades, energy beams, "
"etc. back toward the attacker. If not attacked during blocking, the "
"deflection action emits an attack wave, dealing damage and knockback to a"
" group"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "荷尔蒙控制"
msgstr "Hormone Control"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "hormone"
msgstr "hormone"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>1.开始做出挑逗的动作，同时摆动尾巴<br>2.保持挑逗姿态，继续摆动尾巴一段时间<br>3.回复待机姿态<br>>技能效果介绍<br>如果技能成功释放结束（在空气中散布特殊荷尔蒙物质），会让男性单位陷入迷惑状态，停止行动，并持续消耗体力。让女性单位进入躁郁状态，攻击命中率下降。技能释放过程中受到男性单位攻击会受到暴击伤害"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>1. Begin a provocative gesture while "
"wagging tail<br>2. Maintain provocative pose, continue wagging tail for a"
" period<br>3. Return to idle pose<br>>Skill Effect Description<br>If the "
"skill is successfully completed (releasing special hormone substances "
"into the air), male units enter a confused state, stop acting, and "
"continuously lose stamina. Female units enter an agitated state with "
"reduced attack accuracy. During skill activation, attacks from male units"
" deal critical damage"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "激光飞刃"
msgstr "Laser Flying Blade"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "blade"
msgstr "blade"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>1.单脚后退一步，抬起右臂作蓄力状<br>2.交替向前挥舞两只手臂，向前方发射两次手臂光刃<br>3.回复待机姿态<br>>技能效果介绍<br>以不同的角度发射两个光刃，每个光刃可以对一个单位造成中等伤害"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>1. Step back with one foot, raise right "
"arm in a charging pose<br>2. Alternately swing both arms forward, "
"launching two arm light blades forward<br>3. Return to idle "
"pose<br>>Skill Effect Description<br>Launches two light blades at "
"different angles, each dealing moderate damage to one unit"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "超级忍杀（大招）"
msgstr "Super Ninja Kill (Ultimate)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "ninja"
msgstr "ninja"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>1.手上伸出光刃做攻击准备<br>2.在地面以攻击单位为中心进行左右闪现切割攻击三次<br>3.后跳回到初始位置空中，向攻击单位扔出旋转的光刃<br>4.下落到地面，回复待机姿态<br>>技能效果介绍<br>对攻击范围内的单位连续造成多段伤害，对迷惑状态的单位造成3倍伤害，无击退效果"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>1. Extend light blades from hands in "
"attack preparation<br>2. Flash left and right around the target unit on "
"the ground for three slash attacks<br>3. Back-jump to initial position in"
" the air, throw a spinning light blade at the target<br>4. Descend to the"
" ground, return to idle pose<br>>Skill Effect Description<br>Deals "
"multiple consecutive hits to units within attack range. Deals 3x damage "
"to confused units, no knockback effect"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md:118
msgid "7.小花妖"
msgstr "7. Little Flower Spirit"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "普通待机-花蕾"
msgstr "Normal Idle - Bud"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "bud"
msgstr "bud"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "小花妖的初始姿态是花蕾形态，花蕾状态只会站在原地播放待机"
msgstr ""
"The Little Flower Spirit's initial form is the bud state. In bud state, "
"it only stands in place playing idle animation"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "普通待机-小花妖"
msgstr "Normal Idle - Little Flower Spirit"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "摇摆裙子"
msgstr "Swaying dress"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "丝带和双手下垂，垂下脑袋，进入晕眩待机状态。需要拆成进入晕眩状态和晕眩状态循环待机两个部分"
msgstr ""
"Ribbons and hands droop, head lowers, enters dizzy idle state. Needs to "
"be split into entering dizzy state and dizzy state loop idle"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "开花"
msgstr "Bloom"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "blossom"
msgstr "blossom"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>从花蕾状态开花变为小花妖状态<br>>技能效果介绍<br>花蕾状态的小花妖在开始受到攻击后，累计在5秒内收到的伤害量，作为系数决定5秒后开花的生命值及其它能力值的决定因数"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>Bloom from bud state into Little Flower "
"Spirit state<br>>Skill Effect Description<br>After the bud-state Little "
"Flower Spirit starts taking damage, it accumulates damage received over 5"
" seconds as a coefficient that determines its HP and other stats when it "
"blooms 5 seconds later"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "吸血攻击"
msgstr "Life Drain Attack"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "leech"
msgstr "leech"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>1.身体后仰，两个手臂向后摆，准备发动攻击<br>2.身体前倾，向前水平伸出手臂藤蔓（电缆），达到一倍体长的长度<br>3.收回藤蔓，回复待机姿态<br>>技能效果介绍<br>对藤蔓碰到的复数单位进行吸血攻击，将造成的攻击伤害转换成自身生命，无击退效果"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>1. Lean body backward, both arms swing "
"back, preparing to attack<br>2. Lean body forward, extend arm vines "
"(cables) horizontally to one body length<br>3. Retract vines, return to "
"idle pose<br>>Skill Effect Description<br>Drains life from multiple units"
" touched by the vines, converting attack damage into self-healing, no "
"knockback effect"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "藤蔓缠绕"
msgstr "Vine Entangle"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "pull"
msgstr "pull"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>1.抬起一只手臂<br>2.向前伸长手上的藤蔓到2.5倍体长<br>3.快速拉回藤蔓，并回复待机姿态<br>>技能效果介绍<br>将前方碰到藤蔓的复数单位快速拉到面前，造成体力值消耗"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>1. Raise one arm<br>2. Extend the vine "
"on the hand forward to 2.5x body length<br>3. Quickly retract vine and "
"return to idle pose<br>>Skill Effect Description<br>Quickly pulls "
"multiple units touched by the vine forward to itself, causing stamina "
"depletion"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md:135
msgid "8.大花妖"
msgstr "8. Great Flower Spirit"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "举起右手，向右偏头，眼睛向右下方看，右手的树杈缠绕着扶了扶花枝"
msgstr ""
"Raise right hand, tilt head right, eyes look down-right, branch-wrapped "
"right hand adjusts a flower branch"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "闭上双眼，头微微垂下，双手下垂搭在地上，进入晕眩待机状态。需要拆成进入晕眩状态和晕眩状态循环待机两部分"
msgstr ""
"Close eyes, head slightly lowered, hands droop resting on the ground, "
"enters dizzy idle state. Needs to be split into entering dizzy state and "
"dizzy state loop idle"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "藤蔓击打"
msgstr "Vine Strike"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "attack"
msgstr "attack"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>1.举起一只手臂，同时手臂上的藤蔓伸长<br>2.快速向前击打<br>3.缩回藤蔓，回复待机姿态<br>>技能效果介绍<br>对面前一定距离内的敌人造成中等伤害"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>1. Raise one arm, vines on the arm "
"extend simultaneously<br>2. Strike forward quickly<br>3. Retract vine, "
"return to idle pose<br>>Skill Effect Description<br>Deals moderate damage"
" to enemies within a certain distance ahead"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "twine"
msgstr "twine"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>1.举起双手的藤蔓并快速插入地下<br>2.保持让藤蔓向地下延申的待机状态，同时多根藤蔓由近到远连续冲出地表<br>3.藤蔓回缩地下，手上的树枝从地面拔出<br>>技能效果介绍<br>在将树枝插入地下后，本体处于霸体状态，即技能不会被打断，但是可以收到伤害。碰到地面伸出藤蔓的单位处于中毒状态，持续收到伤害，并心智混乱变成友方(6秒)"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>1. Raise vines on both hands and quickly"
" thrust them underground<br>2. Maintain pose with vines extending "
"underground, while multiple vines burst from the ground sequentially from"
" near to far<br>3. Vines retract underground, branch on hands pulls out "
"from ground<br>>Skill Effect Description<br>After inserting branches "
"underground, the main body enters super armor state — skills cannot be "
"interrupted, but damage can still be received. Units touched by vines "
"bursting from the ground enter poisoned state, taking continuous damage, "
"and become confused turning friendly (6 seconds)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "病毒传输"
msgstr "Virus Transmission"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "transv"
msgstr "transv"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>1.双手的藤蔓伸长<br>2.从下往上交替且平缓地挥舞两条手臂<br>3.回复待机姿态<br>>技能效果介绍<br>使前方一段空间内单位的电子道具感染电脑病毒，受到控制或是失效一段时间。包括智能枪械、机械外骨骼、通讯器和电脑设备等。病毒会导致智能枪械命中友方单位，弹道偏转；机械外骨骼会停止运转，让装备者失去移动或跳跃能力；通讯器会失效导致玩家无法下达团队指令；电脑设备失效导致无法使用"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>1. Vines on both hands extend<br>2. "
"Alternately and smoothly wave both arms from bottom to top<br>3. Return "
"to idle pose<br>>Skill Effect Description<br>Infects electronic equipment"
" of units in the space ahead with a computer virus, causing them to be "
"controlled or disabled for a period. Includes smart firearms, mechanical "
"exoskeletons, communicators, and computer devices. The virus causes smart"
" firearms to hit friendly units with deflected trajectories; mechanical "
"exoskeletons stop functioning, causing the wearer to lose movement or "
"jumping ability; communicators fail, preventing players from issuing team"
" commands; computer devices fail and become unusable"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "播种之舞（大招）"
msgstr "Seeding Dance (Ultimate)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "seed"
msgstr "seed"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>挥舞双臂，摆动头发，做出像是舞蹈的动作<br>>技能效果介绍<br>地面生长出3-5个小花妖的花蕾，受到攻击后变化为小花妖"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>Wave both arms, sway hair, perform "
"dance-like movements<br>>Skill Effect Description<br>3-5 Little Flower "
"Spirit buds grow from the ground, transforming into Little Flower Spirits"
" after being attacked"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md:152
msgid "9.小英招"
msgstr "9. Little Yingzhao"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "低下头，，摇动尾巴，用前脚蹬自己的下巴"
msgstr "Lower head, wag tail, scratch chin with front paw"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "后半身坐在地上，进入晕眩待机状态。需要拆成进入晕眩状态和晕眩状态循环待机两个部分"
msgstr ""
"Hindquarters sit on the ground, enters dizzy idle state. Needs to be "
"split into entering dizzy state and dizzy state loop idle"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "飞扑攻击"
msgstr "Leap Attack"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "jump"
msgstr "jump"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>1.身体后倾，重心向下<br>2.突然向前小跳，爪子前伸进行扑击<br>3.回复待机姿态<br>>技能效果介绍<br>使用抢夺的武器对前方单位进行射击"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>1. Lean body backward, lower center of "
"gravity<br>2. Suddenly leap forward, claws extended for a pounce "
"attack<br>3. Return to idle pose<br>>Skill Effect Description<br>Shoots "
"at units ahead using a stolen weapon"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "铁蹄跟头"
msgstr "Iron Hoof Flip"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "kick"
msgstr "kick"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>做后空翻，同时后面两个铁蹄向前猛踢>技能效果介绍铁蹄可对前方造成单体伤害，造成击退效果"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>Do a backflip while forcefully kicking "
"forward with the two rear iron hooves<br>>Skill Effect "
"Description<br>Iron hooves deal single-target damage ahead, causing "
"knockback effect"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md:167
msgid "10.中英招"
msgstr "10. Mid Yingzhao"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "空手状态的待机"
msgstr "Bare-handed idle"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "持枪待机"
msgstr "Armed Idle"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "gunidle"
msgstr "gunidle"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "手持枪械武器的待机姿态，兼容手枪和长柄枪械"
msgstr ""
"Idle pose holding a firearm, compatible with pistols and long-barreled "
"weapons"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "空手状态的待机，暴躁地跺脚"
msgstr "Bare-handed idle, stamping feet aggressively"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "前后腿膝盖跪地，进入晕眩待机状态。需要拆成进入晕眩状态和晕眩状态循环待机两个部分"
msgstr ""
"Front and rear legs kneel, enters dizzy idle state. Needs to be split "
"into entering dizzy state and dizzy state loop idle"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "缴械冲锋"
msgstr "Disarming Charge"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "rob"
msgstr "rob"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>1.抬起马前蹄做发起冲锋的示意<br>2.马前蹄落地后开始进行持续地奔跑<br>3.做抢夺武器道具的动作<br>4.回复到手持枪械的待机姿态（制作时使用占位道具）<br>>技能效果介绍<br>快速冲到目标单位面前抢夺目标单位携带的武器"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>1. Raise front hooves in a charge "
"signal<br>2. After front hooves land, begin continuous running<br>3. "
"Perform weapon/item snatching motion<br>4. Return to firearm-holding idle"
" pose (use placeholder prop during production)<br>>Skill Effect "
"Description<br>Rushes quickly to the target unit and snatches their "
"carried weapon"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "持械反击"
msgstr "Armed Counter"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "shoot"
msgstr "shoot"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>抬起抢夺的枪械进行单次射击<br>>技能效果介绍<br>使用抢夺的武器对前方单位进行射击"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>Raise stolen firearm and fire a single "
"shot<br>>Skill Effect Description<br>Shoots at units ahead using the "
"stolen weapon"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>进行一次挥拳攻击<br>>技能效果介绍<br>对前方单个单位发动近战攻击，造成少量伤害"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>Perform one punch attack<br>>Skill "
"Effect Description<br>Launches a melee attack on a single unit ahead, "
"dealing minor damage"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md:184
msgid "11.大英招"
msgstr "11. Great Yingzhao"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "抬手看一下自己的斧头武器，然后在空中随手挥一下武器"
msgstr "Raise hand to look at own axe weapon, then casually swing it in the air"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "保持站立姿态，闭眼低下头，两把武器向下垂到地上。需要拆成进入晕眩状态和晕眩状态循环待机两个部分"
msgstr ""
"Maintain standing pose, close eyes and lower head, both weapons droop to "
"the ground. Needs to be split into entering dizzy state and dizzy state "
"loop idle"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "斧头挥砍"
msgstr "Axe Slash"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>1.双手抬起斧头，做发动攻击的准备<br>2.接连向下挥出双持的斧头<br>3.回复待机姿态<br>>技能效果介绍<br>对前方复数单位发动近战攻击，造成伤害"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>1. Raise axes with both hands, preparing"
" to attack<br>2. Consecutively swing dual-wielded axes downward<br>3. "
"Return to idle pose<br>>Skill Effect Description<br>Launches melee attack"
" on multiple units ahead, dealing damage"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "狩猎指挥"
msgstr "Hunting Command"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "hunt"
msgstr "hunt"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>抬起前马蹄，上身向前挺直，同时抬起一只手臂，并用武器向前指，然后回复待机姿态<br>>技能效果介绍<br>做出攻击指示的动作，并立刻召唤两只小英招出现发动飞扑攻击"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>Raise front hooves, upper body "
"straightens forward while raising one arm and pointing weapon forward, "
"then return to idle pose<br>>Skill Effect Description<br>Performs an "
"attack command gesture and immediately summons two Little Yingzhao to "
"launch leap attacks"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "无双挥舞"
msgstr "Unrivaled Swing"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "massive"
msgstr "massive"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>一边向前奔跑一边双持武器发动三连击<br>>技能效果介绍<br>向前移动的同时对自己前方发动三次连击，造成范围的群体攻击效果，击飞受攻击单位"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>Run forward while dual-wielding weapons "
"for a three-hit combo<br>>Skill Effect Description<br>Moves forward while"
" executing three consecutive hits ahead, causing area group attack "
"effect, knocking hit units away"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "地面冲击波"
msgstr "Ground Shockwave"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "wave"
msgstr "wave"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>1.翻转斧头使刀刃部分面朝前方持握，向后挥动手臂，将斧头向地面伸<br>2.突然双手将斧头贴着地面向前挥动直到空中<br>3.回复待机姿态<br>>技能效果介绍<br>掀起一股贴在地面的冲击波，将前方一段距离内碰到的单位击飞"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>1. Flip axes so blade edges face "
"forward, swing arms backward and extend axes toward the ground<br>2. "
"Suddenly sweep both axes along the ground forward into the air with both "
"hands<br>3. Return to idle pose<br>>Skill Effect Description<br>Generates"
" a ground-hugging shockwave, knocking away units within a certain "
"distance ahead"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "英雄袭击（大招）"
msgstr "Heroic Raid (Ultimate)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid "hero"
msgstr "hero"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/monster-spine-action.md
msgid ">技能动画要求<br>转身向后方奔跑并渐隐消失，然后在前方的敌人背后奔跑显现并发动连续的冲刺攻击<br>>技能效果介绍<br>对前方大范围的区域造成多段伤害"
msgstr ""
">Skill Animation Requirements<br>Turn and run backward, gradually fading "
"and disappearing, then appear running from behind enemies ahead, "
"launching consecutive dash attacks<br>>Skill Effect Description<br>Deals "
"multiple hits of damage across a wide area ahead"

